 "_note": "TEST FIXTURE ONLY. A synthetic section library for exercising page_lint's budget and composition checks: invented names, invented budgets, no reach counts. Not any brand's site; never ship it as an engine fallback or as brand truth.",
 "_version": "2026-10-17",
 "pins": null,
 "_budget_method": {
  "how": "chars = (slot width in px / (font size x advance ratio)) x lines. The advance ratio is the average for the brand's own type stacks at these sizes; it is a planning figure, not a renderer.",
  "why": "A slot budget is not a style preference. Components are built to measured geometry: a card title that overruns re-wraps and changes the card's height, and on a fixed-height mobile slide it clips. The budget is the shape of the box the copy has to live in.",
  "confidence": "Budgets are DERIVED, not measured per string. They are a warning threshold, not a ceiling: over budget means look at it in the file, not that it is wrong."
 },
